  "name": "Sun Cleric: every Radiant Flame tick is a direct hit for Vows and spends a Dawn charge (#12951)",
  "contract": [
    "#12951: Radiant Flame (560867, rank of 806060) is a 4 sec channel whose aura 227 fires Radiant Flame 807058",
    "at the target every second, with an extra initial tick. #10147 made Check() treat any spell fired by a",
    "periodic-trigger aura as periodic so Hammer of Kings and Dawnfall stop fulfilling Vows; it exempted Sunslam",
    "(805629, 807970-807974, ruled per tick by #9148) but not Radiant Flame, so no tick counted as direct ability",
    "damage and Dawn was spent once when the channel started. Expected behaviour follows the PR author's review",
    "on 2026-11-20 of original Ascension footage (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZZwP04HEkq4): under Vow of",
    "Radiance every tick builds 2 Solar Power, and under Dawn every tick spends a Dawn charge. The author ruled",
    "that each tick is a direct hit for every Vow, like Sunslam. The fix exempts the Radiant Flame channel from",
    "the periodic rule, guards Fulfillment per tick, and spends Dawn per tick instead of at channel start.",
    "DISCRIMINATING, each on its own cleric and dummy: Vow of Radiance 803489 gives exactly 2 Solar Power per",
    "tick; Vow of Grace 803719 logs one mana energize (504877) per tick; Vow of Dawn 803491 bounces 803493 to",
    "exactly Amount(803492) = 2 more enemies per tick: its target stands 20 yards out, 15 yards from the other",
    "clerics' dummies, with two bounce dummies 3 and 7 yards past it that each take one bounce per tick, a",
    "control 25 yards past it that takes none, and no bounce on the target itself or from a cleric without the",
    "Vow; with Dawn up, Dawn charges fall from 10 by exactly the tick count (5) and Solar Power stays at 0",
    "because Dawn blocks it. Before the fix each of these was 0, and Dawn lost one charge."
  ],
